<Base title="About Gabriel Pascualy" description="Gabriel Pascualy is Head of Product at Ketryx, working on AI for regulated product development.">
  <article class="about-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>Hi, I’m Gabriel.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">I lead product at <a href="https://www.ketryx.com/">Ketryx</a>, where we build AI for teams developing regulated software.</p>
      <p>My work brings together product, engineering, and quality. I’m interested in how people use AI in complex workflows, how they decide what to trust, and how we make useful software easier to build.</p>
      <p>This site is a home for my essays and working notes on those questions. I also want it to be a place to connect with people building and thinking about similar things.</p>
      <h2>Find me elsewhere</h2>
      <ul class="about-links">
        <li><a href="https://x.com/gpascualy">Twitter / X</a><span>@gpascualy</span></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/pascualy">GitHub</a><span>pascualy</span></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.ketryx.com/">Ketryx</a><span>My work</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
